      <h2 class="guide-section__title">Use of the Program</h2>
      <p>Open Phonics is provided as an educational tool for teaching reading through systematic phonics. It is designed to be used by adults (teachers, tutors, parents) working with learners.</p>
      <p>The program is provided "as is" without warranty of any kind. We do not guarantee specific educational outcomes. The effectiveness of the program depends on consistent, correct use following the Direct Instruction methodology.</p>
