    <section class="guide-section">
      <h2 class="guide-section__title">Content</h2>
      <p>The lesson content, stories, and word lists are original works created for this project. The instructional methodology is based on publicly available Direct Instruction principles developed by Siegfried Engelmann.</p>
      <p>The fonts used (Lora, Source Sans 3, Comic Neue) are open-source fonts served via Bunny Fonts.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="guide-section">
      <h2 class="guide-section__title">No Data Collection</h2>
      <p>As described in our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>, Open Phonics does not collect or store any personal data on our servers. All progress data is stored locally on your device.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="guide-section">
      <h2 class="guide-section__title">Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>Open Phonics is not a substitute for professional educational assessment or intervention. If a learner is experiencing significant reading difficulties, consult a qualified reading specialist or educator.</p>
